  "prefLabel": "Site 102.50 Significant wildlife species",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.50 “Significant wildlife species” means:\n\n(a) Any species listed as threatened or endangered, or which is a candidate for such listing, by the United States fish and wildlife service; or\n\n(b) Any species listed as threatened, endangered, or of special concern by the New Hampshire department of fish and game.\n\nSource. #10993, eff 12-16-15",
